  <diagram id="p2" name="3 - Implementation notes">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1340" pageHeight="1120" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="title" value="CLOSED-FORM DESIGN RULES" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E5DDF3;strokeColor=#7D5CA6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=16;fontColor=#17212F;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="250" y="50" width="800" height="90" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a" value="1. Every customer response has a predefined intent (not a numbered selection)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F3F5;strokeColor=#858B95;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=16;fontColor=#17212F;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="120" y="200" width="1080" height="85" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b" value="2. The wizard listens to the participant and clicks the matching intent in MATLAB." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F3F5;strokeColor=#858B95;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=16;fontColor=#17212F;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="120" y="320" width="1080" height="85" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c" value="3. Every waiter response is a prerecorded WAV clip with a stable ID." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F3F5;strokeColor=#858B95;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=16;fontColor=#17212F;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="120" y="440" width="1080" height="85" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d" value="4. Free-form wording can map to a fixed intent; unsupported replies trigger a fallback." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F3F5;strokeColor=#858B95;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=16;fontColor=#17212F;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="120" y="560" width="1080" height="85" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e" value="5. The same dialogue state can be revisited (e.g., ask about specials again)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F3F5;strokeColor=#858B95;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=16;fontColor=#17212F;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="120" y="680" width="1080" height="85" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f" value="6. Replace [chosen dish] and [chosen drink] with concrete prerecorded combinations or record separate segments." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F3F5;strokeColor=#858B95;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=16;fontColor=#17212F;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="120" y="800" width="1080" height="100" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="g" value="Suggested fallback waiter line: “Sorry, could you choose from our menu?”" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D9E9FF;strokeColor=#3569A7;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=16;fontColor=#17212F;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="120" y="940" width="1080" height="85" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
